# Source distribution: the package, its data, documentation and examples.
# Not included: tests/ (with the TRIM.exe / SRModule.exe reference outputs,
# about 8 MB) and the reverse-engineering helpers in tools/.
include LICENSE README.md CHANGELOG.md CITATION.cff
recursive-include lunasrim/data *
recursive-include lunasrim/web/static *
recursive-include docs *.md
recursive-include examples *.py *.md
prune tests
prune tools
prune output
prune site
prune dist
prune build
